# Casting is not copying (CR 707.10): Show-Off gets +2 per spell cast, not per copy. On turn three Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt
# (power 3) and then Brain Freeze with storm; Brain Freeze's one storm copy is put on the stack, not cast, so the power is 5
# and not 7. (Bot2 also discards its eighth card to hand size, hence 7 cards in its graveyard.)

